flowchart TD
  BLANK["`**Blank draft**<br/>idle ledger agenda`"]
  TASKS["`**Go To · Tasks**<br/>draft is one slash`"]
  NOTES["`**Go To · Notes**<br/>draft is two slashes`"]
  LIT["`**Literal backslash**<br/>ordinary prose draft`"]
  OPEN["`**Open in Obsidian**<br/>discard draft, hide panel`"]
  BLANK -->|"slash, or the<br/>backslash alias"| TASKS
